OL,3,GNEWSA'Unwise' for legal professionals
OL,4,Ato give character references, says NI's
OL,5,Atop judge
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is "unwise" for members of the legal
OL,8,Fprofession to give character
OL,9,Freferences, the Lady Chief Justice has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FDame Siobhan Keegan said she intends to
OL,13,Fhave her sentencing group look at
OL,14,Fcharacter references amid concerns from
OL,15,Fvictims that they have no opportunity
OL,16,Fto challenge them in court.
OL,18,FEarlier this year, the Law Society
OL,19,Fchief executive, David Lavery, provided
OL,20,Fa character reference for a cousin
OL,21,Fconvicted of serious sexual offences.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
