OL,3,GNEWSA'Unwise' for legal professionals
OL,4,Ato give character references, says NI's
OL,5,Atop judge
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday members of the Law Society
OL,8,Fare expected to vote on whether they
OL,9,Fhave confidence in Lavery.
